Votes

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:54.760
Shun       Aoi

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:56.590
Taichi

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:56.590
Gorou

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:56.590
Sousuke

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:56.590
Prince
Role

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:01.680
Why do I have to play the prince?!

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:04.180
You're such a girl, too.

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:07.060
Shouldn't a prince be a guy's part?

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:09.400
Sorry, it's my fault.

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:11.020
It's not your fault, Subaru.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:14.030
That sounds like you're trying
to say this is all my fault.

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:15.780
I am, you jelly roll.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:18.110
Prince
Role

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:18.110
Princess
Role

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:18.110
36th
Theater
Festival

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:18.110
