00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:18.850
You had to get carried away just
because no one else can see you!

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:26.200
Okay, then Aoi will
play the role of the prince!

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:23.660
Sousuke

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:23.660
Prince
Role

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:23.740
Aoi

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:23.790
Shun

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:24.330
Gorou

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:24.870
Taichi

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:28.660
36th
